stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> PANNING : pan gesture starts (isTop=true, drawer closed)
    IDLE --> FLYING_OFF : swipeLeft or swipeRight called via ref
    IDLE --> DRAWER_OPEN : info button pressed

    note right of IDLE
        Photo navigation active in any top-card state.
        Tap left half for prev photo.
        Tap right half for next photo.
    end note

    state PANNING {
        [*] --> Dragging
        Dragging --> SpringBack : pan ends within 120px threshold
        Dragging --> FLYING_OFF : exceeds 120px threshold
        SpringBack --> [*]
    }

    state FLYING_OFF {
        [*] --> Animating
        Animating --> Removed : off-screen animation done, onSwipe fires
    }

    state DRAWER_OPEN {
        [*] --> InfoVisible
        InfoVisible --> Closing : close or backdrop pressed
        Closing --> [*] : drawerProgress to 0 over 220ms
    }

    note right of DRAWER_OPEN
        Pan gesture disabled while drawer is open.
        drawerProgress animated to 1 on open.
    end note

    DRAWER_OPEN --> IDLE : drawer closes
    PANNING --> IDLE : spring back completes
